#: inc/customizer.php:104
msgid "Brand"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:107
msgid "Logo, site icon (the mark in the browser tab) and header image. WordPress otherwise spreads these three over two other sections; they sit together here because they are set together. They are the same settings, with the same cropper."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:126
msgid "Show header image"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:127
msgid "Without an uploaded image nothing happens here — the pages then look exactly as they do now."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:131
msgid "On all pages"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:132
msgid "On the front pages only"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:139
msgid "Product"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:142
msgid "Applies to every product page in every language. The page content uses the placeholders %STORE_URL% and %DOWNLOAD_URL% for them."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:151
msgid "Microsoft Store address"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:152
msgid "Once the app is published. While the field is empty the button leads nowhere."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:164
msgid "Direct download address"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:165
msgid "The installer alongside the Store. Placeholder in the page content: %DOWNLOAD_URL%."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:174
msgid "Header"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:177
msgid "The logo is in the Brand section. The links come from the \"Main navigation\" menu of each language."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:186
msgid "Arrangement"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:187
msgid "Where the brand, the navigation and the language switch sit. On narrow devices the bar wraps anyway — every arrangement looks the same there."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:191
msgid "Brand left, navigation right"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:192
msgid "Brand left, navigation next to it"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:193
msgid "Brand centred, navigation below"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:194
msgid "Navigation left, brand right"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:204
msgid "Keep the header bar in view"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:205
msgid "It stays at the top while scrolling, slightly translucent. Off means it scrolls away with the content. On long legal texts keeping it is kinder, because the way back stays within reach."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:216
msgid "Header bar height"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:217
msgid "In pixels, 66 by default. Does not apply to the centred arrangement — that one follows its contents — nor to narrow devices."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:229
msgid "Rule below the header bar"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:230
msgid "Without it the sticky bar blurs into the content below as soon as both share a colour."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:241
msgid "Show the language switch"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:242
msgid "It points at the counterpart of the current page, not merely at the other front page. From three languages on it turns into a list by itself."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:250
msgid "Footer"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:253
msgid "Further links do not belong here but in the \"Footer\" menu of each language — there they can be sorted, nested and pointed outwards. Privacy and imprint are appended by the theme should they be missing from the menu."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:262
msgid "Append privacy and imprint automatically"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:263
msgid "They are appended only when no menu item points at those addresses — the comparison is by address, not by label, so you may name them as you like in the menu. Switch this off and the footer shows nothing but the menu: convenient while arranging things, and your own responsibility afterwards, because an imprint has to stay reachable."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:274
msgid "Layout"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:275
msgid "Columns are worth it from roughly five links onwards. The top level menu items then become column headings and their children the links below."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:279
msgid "One row (few links)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:280
msgid "Columns (menu with sub-items)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:292
msgid "Line on the left (%s)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:293
msgid "%YEAR% is replaced by the current year."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:305
msgid "Closing note (%s)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:306
msgid "A second, quieter line below. Leaving it empty hides it."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:318
msgid "Contact address in the footer"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:319
msgid "Emitted as a mailto link, with the characters obfuscated."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:330
msgid "Show the contact address"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:354
msgid "Design"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:357
msgid "Font size, measure and dark mode. The colours are in the two sections below."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:366
msgid "Base font size"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:367
msgid "In pixels, 17 by default. Headings and lead paragraphs are calculated from it; on narrow devices it stays one pixel smaller automatically."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:379
msgid "Maximum page width"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:380
msgid "In pixels, 1180 by default. Affects header, footer and the sections — not the text column itself, which stays at 66 characters because longer lines read worse."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:392
msgid "Ship a dark mode"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:393
msgid "The site follows the operating system setting. A program with seventeen colour schemes should not advertise on a site that knows only one — switching this off is meant for an emergency rather than for taste."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:401
msgid "Colours — light mode"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:401
msgid "The default. A value left unchanged emits nothing at all."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:402
msgid "Colours — dark mode"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:402
msgid "Applies when the operating system is set to dark. The same colours a shade lighter will not do — on a dark ground every colour reads stronger."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:410
msgid "The text on coloured surfaces is not chosen but calculated from WCAG luminance — so the button label stays legible whatever colour sits beneath it."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:431
msgid "Head metadata and share image"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:434
msgid "canonical, hreflang and the Open Graph tags come from the theme, because only it recognises the language from the path. Title and description of individual pages live in the editor: the title as the page title, the description in the \"Excerpt\" field."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:443
msgid "Emit head metadata from the theme"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:444
msgid "Switch off only if the job should go back to a plugin. While the box is ticked the matching Yoast output is suppressed so that nothing sits in the head twice."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:457
msgid "Default description (%s)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:458
msgid "Only for pages without an excerpt of their own. About 150 characters."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:470
msgid "Share image (%s)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:471
msgid "1200×630. A fallback only — the page's featured image counts first, then the matching file in /assets/."
msgstr ""

